    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Shnanak Corp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where a simple pigeon monster from the cleaning staff is about to turn this monster-filled workplace upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.poster.avif?t=1743603856\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.webm?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.mp4?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a despised janitor who's tired of being stepped on and climb through Shnanak Corp. by <strong>devouring your enemies</strong> to gain rewards and <strong>become more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.poster.avif?t=1743603856\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.webm?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.mp4?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A turn-based combat with a clear and unique battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A roguelite with multiple factors, collecting cells and increasing your stats after eating each monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Event systems that allow you to modify cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple biomes that offer unique combat encounters in each sub-company within Shnanak Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A system of unique enemy-specific abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Shnanak Corp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where a simple pigeon monster from the cleaning staff is about to turn this monster-filled workplace upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.poster.avif?t=1743603856\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.webm?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/a3e7bba02e03de42fd66f5f2a1fe38ea.mp4?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a despised janitor who's tired of being stepped on and climb through Shnanak Corp. by <strong>devouring your enemies</strong> to gain rewards and <strong>become more powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.poster.avif?t=1743603856\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.webm?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433240/extras/7a2544cadd1ac695a73e502a28f4e454.mp4?t=1743603856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A turn-based combat with a clear and unique battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A roguelite with multiple factors, collecting cells and increasing your stats after eating each monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Event systems that allow you to modify cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple biomes that offer unique combat encounters in each sub-company within Shnanak Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A system of unique enemy-specific abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
